- aria-label on all icon-only buttons (lobby, copy, export, import,
  emergency panic); aria-hidden on decorative icons
- Role switcher converted to role=radiogroup/radio with aria-checked
- Dual Mode toggle gets aria-pressed
- Sync status badge wrapped in role=status/aria-live=polite
- Replaced blocking alert() calls on backup import with inline
  aria-live feedback message
- motion-reduce:animate-none on pulsing/spinning indicators
- focus-visible rings added throughout (was outline default only)
- 'Syncing...' -> 'Syncing\u2026'

Navigation.tsx + App.tsx:
- Module nav converted to role=tablist/tab with aria-selected,
  aria-disabled for locked modules, aria-controls wired to a
  matching role=tabpanel in App.tsx
- Locked-state 'sr-only' text for screen reader users
- Safety Triage shortcut gets a proper aria-label (was title-only)
- focus-visible rings on all nav buttons
