From ced4c6967bcc469e6a3e874e54d61bc058d4592e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Ketcham <jay@smoothestmove.dev>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 13:06:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] a11y: form label association, focus-visible rings, live
 regions

- htmlFor/id pairing for every form control in TimelineVaultView,
  MicroCommitmentDashboard, TransparencySunsetView, LobbyPairingModal
  (previously sibling <label> elements with no programmatic association)
- sr-only labels for icon-adjacent or visually-implicit inputs
  (AttunementCoachView composer, proof-detail textarea, answer draft)
- LobbyPairingModal converted to full accessible dialog (role=dialog,
  aria-modal, focus trap via useModalA11y, aria-label close button) \u2014
  was missing the same modal semantics fixed earlier for the two
  triage/panic modals
- role=alert on NLP guardrail warnings (TimelineVaultView,
  AttunementCoachView) and hard-stop triage result
- role=radiogroup/radio for LobbyPairingModal's device role selector,
  matching the pattern used in Header's participant role switcher
- focus-visible rings added to every remaining outline-none instance
  across all touched files (zero bare outline-none remain)
- aria-hidden on all decorative icons in these files
- motion-reduce:animate-none on all pulse/bounce/spin animations
- inputMode=decimal + autoComplete=off on financial-cost fields
- curly quotes/ellipses in template text and placeholders
