From: Jay Ketcham <jay@smoothestmove.dev>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 13:13:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] a11y: global prefers-reduced-motion, eliminate
 transition: all

index.css:
- Added a global prefers-reduced-motion media query: caps all
  animation/transition durations to near-zero and disables looping
  decorative animations (heart-pulse, bci-gradient shimmer)
- Exception: .animate-somatic-breath (Module 2's 4-7-8 breathing
  pacer) keeps running under reduced-motion since its timing is the
  clinical exercise itself, not decoration \u2014 its scale/glow range is
  softened instead of disabled, via a new breathCycleReduced keyframe
- .glass-card's 'transition: all' replaced with explicit
  background-color/border-color/box-shadow properties

Component-wide:
- Replaced all 10 remaining transition-all Tailwind utility usages
  with transition-colors (every case only animated color/background/
  border-color, never layout-affecting properties)
- BiometricFloodingView: role=alert on flooding lockout banner,
  motion-reduce:animate-none on its pulse, focus-visible rings and
  aria-hidden on buttons/icons, curly ellipsis in status text
